# Milestone: M5
# Covers: whenever (cond) body — level-trigger semantics; body fires on every
#         eval pass where condition is truthy, not just on rising edge; contrast
#         with at() which fires only on false→true transition.
#
# defer-to: M5-scratch-frame
#
# Reason:
#   whenever uses UWATCHER_WHENEVER mode; watcher_eval_dirty (uwatcher_eval.c)
#   calls spawn_body_coroutine whenever the condition is truthy (not just rising).
#   spawn_body_coroutine is a stub at M5 (requires urbi_strand_create + the step
#   driver to run the body coroutine).  The distinction between AT and WHENEVER
#   level semantics is verified in test_at_fire_paths.c.
#
# Activate when scratch-frame + coroutine spawn is wired.
#
# Urbiscript source (activate at M5 scratch-frame):
#   var cnt = 0;
#   var trigger = 1;
#   whenever (trigger > 0) Realm.cnt = Realm.cnt + 1;
#   Realm.trigger = 0;
#   cnt
#   --- expected output ---
#   [00000000] 0
#   [00000001] 1
#   [00000002] nil
#   [00000003] 0
#   [00000004] 1
